{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"saveMeta","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"docKey","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"bytes","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation4DataV","text":"Data","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The key of the document whose header is being recorded."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"docKey"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The serialized header.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"bytes"}]},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"It leaves the snapshot alone – an online client syncs constantly, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"re-snapshotting per sync would reintroduce the cost this interface exists to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"avoid – and it leaves the "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"log","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" alone too."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"That second part is load-bearing. The log does two jobs: it holds un-pushed","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"changes so they survive a reload, and it is the delta between the snapshot and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the document’s current content. Deleting acknowledged entries serves the first","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"job and destroys the second, because nothing brings the snapshot forward on a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"push-ack – the content would then exist in neither place while the persisted","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"serverSeq","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" claims the server has it. Only compaction trims the log, and it does"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so by folding the entries into a new snapshot first."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The header itself carries the acknowledged ","type":"text"},{"code":"clientSeq","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", so a restore reads it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"from there; the store needs no separate parameter for it.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"It is a no-op when nothing is stored for the key."}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Any error the underlying storage raises.","type":"text"}]}],"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"Throws"}],"kind":"content"}],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Instance Method","modules":[{"name":"Yorkie"}],"symbolKind":"method","externalID":"s:6Yorkie14MemoryDocStoreC8saveMeta6docKey5bytesySS_10Foundation4DataVtYaKF","role":"symbol","title":"saveMeta(docKey:bytes:)","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"saveMeta","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"docKey","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"bytes","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Data","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation4DataV"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"}]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/MemoryDocStore\/saveMeta(docKey:bytes:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie","doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/MemoryDocStore"]]},"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/yorkie\/memorydocstore\/savemeta(dockey:bytes:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Records the post-sync header."}],"references":{"doc://Yorkie/documentation/Yorkie/MemoryDocStore/saveMeta(docKey:bytes:)":{"title":"saveMeta(docKey:bytes:)","url":"\/documentation\/yorkie\/memorydocstore\/savemeta(dockey:bytes:)","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"saveMeta","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"docKey","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"bytes","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Data","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation4DataV"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Records the post-sync header."}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/MemoryDocStore\/saveMeta(docKey:bytes:)","role":"symbol"},"doc://Yorkie/documentation/Yorkie/MemoryDocStore":{"title":"MemoryDocStore","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MemoryDocStore","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/yorkie\/memorydocstore","fragments":[{"text":"actor","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MemoryDocStore","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"A ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/DocStore","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" that keeps documents in memory for the lifetime of the process.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/MemoryDocStore","role":"symbol"},"doc://Yorkie/documentation/Yorkie":{"title":"Yorkie","url":"\/documentation\/yorkie","identifier":"doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie","kind":"symbol","role":"collection","abstract":[],"type":"topic"},"doc://Yorkie/documentation/Yorkie/DocStore":{"url":"\/documentation\/yorkie\/docstore","fragments":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"DocStore","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/DocStore","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"DocStore"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A pluggable persistence backend for offline document state."}],"title":"DocStore"}}}